description:
Implement `useCompoundState` — a hook that manages state alongside a memoized derived value computed from that state.

**Example:**
```tsx
const { state, derived, setState } = useCompoundState(
  { items: [], filter: '' },
  (s) => s.items.filter(i => i.includes(s.filter))
);
// derived is always in sync with state, memoized
```

